        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Looking for a Melt Stories<br><em>alternative in audio?</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Melt Stories offers stories to read. With Caresse, listen to a personalized audio session that speaks your chosen names, solo or together. Download on iPhone or Android: demos are free, with no Caresse account. Then create your own sessions with credits, without a subscription."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the app free</a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Anonymous mode · No Caresse sign-up · Free demos<br>Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
