        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "From a free demo to your own audio session."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "margin-bottom:18px;"
              },
              "html": "<strong>Discover the voice.</strong> Download Caresse and listen to free, pre-generated demos without a Caresse account. Hear the tone and format before buying credits."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "margin-bottom:18px;"
              },
              "html": "<strong>Choose your setup.</strong> For example: duo mode, the names Alex and Sam, a romantic mood and the preferences you both agree to. Solo mode is also available."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Create, then listen.</strong> Generating your personalized session uses a paid credit, without a subscription. Once the audio is ready, the voice guides the fiction. Each person remains free to pause, skip a suggestion or stop."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
