          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The detail"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Two approaches, two philosophies."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Melt generates erotic text. Caresse generates audio. Same personalization philosophy, radically different medium."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p>\n                <h3>A personalized audio scenario, in your names.</h3>\n                <p>Before any purchase, you have access to pre-generated audio demos, in French, English and Spanish. No sign-up, no account, no email: you immediately hear the sound quality, the voice grain, the atmosphere and the intensity levels. Demos don't carry your name and don't use your profile, but they give a faithful picture of what you'll experience.</p>\n                <p>When you launch a custom session, Caresse builds a scenario from your profile: who you are, what you're called, what draws you tonight, the intensity level, the atmosphere. The voice names you. The scenario looks like no other, because it was written only for that session. And the entire app works anonymously — with purchases through your Apple or Google account. Each generated experience is then available for life.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Audio demos playable without an account (FR · EN · ES)</li>\n                    <li>Anonymous mode, no Caresse account required</li>\n                    <li>Names spoken in the narration</li>\n                    <li>Duration varies with the generated session</li>\n                    <li>Virtually infinite combinations: genders, practices, accessories, intensity, location, atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>Native duo and solo modes</li>\n                    <li>€1.99 / €5.49 / €7.99 — experiences available for life</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card muted"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Melt Stories</p>\n                <h3>Personalized erotic text, no account needed.</h3>\n                <p>Melt Stories creates personalized erotic fiction for couples and solo readers. You choose a mood, scene, characters and intensity, then read, continue, branch or edit the generated story. No account is needed to start, and several full stories are free.</p>\n                <p>It's a good option if you want interactive text at your own reading pace. Frequent readers can subscribe for unlimited generation. It's less suited if you want a screen-free audio session or want to hear your chosen names spoken aloud.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>AI-generated erotic text stories</li>\n                    <li>Personalization with your names and preferences</li>\n                    <li>No account needed to start</li>\n                    <li>English, French, German, Spanish and Brazilian Portuguese</li>\n                    <li>Several stories free; subscription for unlimited generation</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
