                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and audio demos. Personalized sessions use credits, with no subscription or monthly renewal.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Melt Stories</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Free + subscription</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">Several full stories are free. Unlimited generation requires a subscription; the public site does not display its price.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "Caresse euro pricing references published in June 2026. Check current prices in the app before purchasing. Melt information verified on its official site on 5 September 2026; offers may change."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No disguised marketing. Here's who each app serves best."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you prefer…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen rather than read — a voice that narrates, not a screen to scroll</li>\n                    <li>to use anonymous mode without creating a Caresse account</li>\n                    <li>your names spoken aloud in the narration</li>\n                    <li>an eyes-closed, screen-free experience</li>\n                    <li>a guided audio experience in French, English, Spanish or Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                    <li>to pay per session with transparent prices (€1.99 / €5.49 / €7.99)</li>\n                    <li>each generated session saved for life, no account required</li>\n                    <li>generated audio in FR, EN, ES and PT (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Melt if you prefer…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>reading an erotic story rather than listening to one</li>\n                    <li>a literary, narrative format at your own reading pace</li>\n                    <li>AI-personalized erotic text in five languages, without signing up to start</li>\n                    <li>to generate erotic text with your own parameters</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Staying with audio but want an established English-language catalog? See our comparison with <a href=\"/en/vs-dipsea/\">Dipsea</a>. Prefer a French pre-recorded library? Check out <a href=\"/en/vs-melba/\">Caresse vs Melba</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Melt — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I download Melt Stories from this page?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. This page’s download buttons open Caresse on the App Store or Google Play. Caresse is a separate app offering personalized audio sessions. This comparison does not distribute the Melt Stories app."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I buy sessions in anonymous mode?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse and buy sessions without creating a Caresse account. Purchases go through the App Store or Google Play and require an Apple or Google account on the store you use, with its payment method. Anonymous mode applies to your use of Caresse, not to the transaction with the store."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Melt Stories free?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Melt lets you start in the browser without creating an account and offers several full stories for free. Frequent readers can subscribe for unlimited generation, though its public website does not display the subscription price. Caresse publishes its pay-per-session prices up front — €1.99, €5.49 or €7.99 — and its audio demos play free in the app without an account."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse a good Melt Stories alternative?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes if you like the personalized premise but want audio instead of text. Caresse creates a guided audio session using your chosen names, with a duration that varies with generation. Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish. You can try the free demos without a Caresse account before buying credits."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do Caresse and Melt require an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Neither requires an account to start. Melt lets you begin a story without sign-up. Caresse does not require a Caresse account, even to buy sessions, and offers free audio demos in the app so you can hear the quality before buying anything."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What is the real difference between Caresse and Melt?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The medium. Melt generates erotic text you read. Caresse generates audio you listen to — a synthesized voice speaks your names and narrates a scenario whose duration varies with generation. Same AI personalization logic, radically different experience."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse and Melt: audio or text, in which languages?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish. Melt publishes text experiences in English, French, German, Spanish and Brazilian Portuguese. The meaningful difference is therefore audio versus text, not simply language availability."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How much does Caresse cost?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse displays its prices clearly: €1.99 for 1 audio experience, €5.49 for 3, €7.99 for 5. Each generated experience is available for life. Melt offers several stories free and a subscription for unlimited generation, but does not display the subscription price publicly."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can you really compare Caresse and Melt?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Not directly — they are different mediums. Melt makes you read a generated erotic story. Caresse makes you listen to a scenario narrated by a voice that speaks your name. Eyes-closed, screen-free vs literary reading experience. Both AI-personalized, both without a mandatory account. The free Caresse audio demos let you hear the difference before buying."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How many different scenarios can Caresse generate?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The combinations are virtually infinite. Each profile combines participants' genders, names, practices, accessories, intensity level, dirty-talk level, location and atmosphere. You never listen to the same thing twice."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
